====== COMFAST CF-E110N ======

{{:media:comfast:cfe110nr.jpg?200|CF-E110N right view (image from comfast.com.cn)}}  

The [[http://en.comfast.com.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=19&id=22|COMFAST CF-E110N]] is an outdoor 2.4 GHz wireless CPE. It is based on the [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx|Qualcomm Atheros QCA9531 or QCA9533]] SoC, and features two RJ45 10/100 Mbps Ethernet ports with PoE in and a 300 Mbps 2.4 GHz 802.11b/g/n radio connected to an internal 2T2R 11 dBi antenna. 

Note: The COMFAST CF-E110N shares many features with the COMFAST CF-E5, deploying the same chipset. The CF-E5 PCI-e interface is the key differentiator.



