^ TFTP transfer window                 | 1 seconds                                |
^ TFTP window start                    | approximately 5 seconds after power on   |



===== Upgrading OpenWrt =====
You can read the general OpenWrt upgrading instructions [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.sysupgrade|here]].

==== LuCI web upgrade process ====

  * Browse to ''<nowiki>http://192.168.1.1/cgi-bin/luci/admin/system/flashops</nowiki>'' LuCI's upgrade URL (replace 192.168.1.1 with the router's IP)
  * Upload image file for sysupgrade to LuCI
  * Wait for reboot

==== Terminal Upgrade Process ====

If you don't have a GUI (LuCI) available, you can alternatively upgrade via the command line.

=== sysupgrade ===

  * Login as root via SSH on your router, then enter the following commands:

<code>
cd /tmp
wget http://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/trunk/XXX/xxx.abc
sysupgrade /tmp/xxx.abc
</code>

