==== Buttons ====
The device has a push button, labeled "RST", and a two-positions slide switch, labeled "STA AP. The push button is used to reset the device, restore it to factory defaults or enter into [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:failsafe_and_factory_reset|failsafe mode]]. The slide switch is meant to change between station or access point using the stock firmware.

^ Button ^ GPIO port ^ Event ^
| RST |  17  | reset |

^ Slide switch ^ GPIO port ^ Values ^ Event ^
| STA AP  |  1  | 0: AP. 1: STA | none |




